<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek Jan-June industry output 5.4 pct up yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Uzbek Jan-June industry output 5.4 pct up yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan's industrial output rose by 5.4 percent in the first half of the year, compared to a five-percent rise in the same period last year, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	  Jan-Jun 97   Jan-Jun 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	     +5.4	   +5.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
